                                        "sense_id": "268f286a-54e5-3568-b224-44a5a1b5f6b4",
                                        "entry_id": "64291be6-03f4-37b2-8168-cbb3565b0cd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of granular snow formed by repeated melting and refreezing, often in mountain spring conditions."
